      "Pop. 55-64 Share (2000) & 1.348$^{***}$ & (0.032) \\\\\n",
      "Baseline Pop. 65+ Share (2000) & -1.236$^{***}$ & (0.032) \\\\\n",
      "Region: South & -0.163$^{***}$ & (0.028) \\\\\n",
      "Log Total Population & -0.155$^{***}$ & (0.036) \\\\\n",
      "Mining Employment Share & -0.152$^{***}$ & (0.020) \\\\\n",
      "Region: West & 0.094$^{***}$ & (0.033) \\\\\n",
      "Seasonal Housing Share & 0.080$^{***}$ & (0.024) \\\\\n",
      "Rural Indicator & 0.060$^{**}$ & (0.028) \\\\\n",
      "Coastal County & 0.043$^{**}$ & (0.021) \\\\\n",
      "Healthcare Employment Share & -0.042$^{**}$ & (0.021) \\\\\n",
